# Keys whose value is legitimately identical to English in every locale.
#
# Kept deliberately tiny. A generous allowlist defeats the script-coverage
# check entirely, and that check is the only thing standing between a parallel
# translation fan-out and ten agents pasting English to make the key counts
# reconcile.
#
# The bar: the string contains NO translatable words. Every entry below is a
# pure format string — placeholders and punctuation only. There is nothing in
# them a translator could render differently.
#
appTitle
meUsageValue              # "{used} / {limit}"
parentHotlinePhoneMask    # "•••• {last4}"
assessmentScannerMarks    # "{awarded}/{max}"
